<Layout
  title="Andreas Andreou — Law, institutions & better systems"
  description="Andreas Andreou works across law, public institutions and technology to help consequential ideas become practical outcomes."
>
  <section class="hero wrap">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Business · Government · Technology</span>
      <h1>Making complex systems more useful.</h1>
      <p class="lede">I work where law, markets and public institutions meet — advising organisations, serving locally and building practical tools for better decisions. My experience spans commercial practice, public service and procurement innovation across Greece and Cyprus.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="text-link" href="#work">Explore the work ↓</a>
        <a class="text-link" href="/bio">Read the story ↗</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-visual">
      <img src="/assets/local-field.png" alt="Aerial view of a landscape and road" />
      <div class="hero-label"><strong>Athens · Greece</strong><br />Law, public service and building</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section wrap split">
    <div><span class="eyebrow">The through-line</span></div>
    <div>
      <h2>Different roles. The same question.</h2>
      <p>How can law, market intelligence and technology help institutions create more value for the people who depend on them? My practice moves between commercial advice, local government and public-sector innovation.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

